```

</details>

#### still allows arithmetic indexes

- Verify: still allows arithmetic indexes
   - Expected: parse_fails("fn main() -> i64:\n    val arr = [1, 2, 3]\n    return arr[1 + 1]") is false


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

